{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0063_1000_p", "source_sha256": "16ccfa1509b4ed3606e88b79cb43334f60dadecc998fd971856a675e22466cc3", "ja": "（夏祭りのライブまで、あと2日……\n準備も終わったし、あとは本番を迎えるだけだな）", "zh": "（距离夏日祭典的演唱会，还有两天……\n准备也都就绪了，之后就是等正式上台吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0063_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "30b131ad267007dadbd743ba6199186ccb5d9fe8556f736ba1bff49fc8ba2ab1", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\n今度の、お祭りのライブのことなんだけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n关于这次的祭典演唱会啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0063_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "7e30b7867f1ef8ca5c249e5a6716d485c1eb1c8f1bcb3c8f6c283dbf1ecb38c6", "ja": "お祭りのさいごに、花火があるでしょ。\nその時間まで残ってたら、帰るのおそくなっちゃう？", "zh": "祭典最后会放烟火对吧？\n要是留下来看烟火，回家时间会太晚吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0063_1003_p", "source_sha256": "484cdc8aa94bf1b0a0c17b74825f9a94a2294004e06e82bacb4e2d0354096984", "ja": "まぁ、お祭りの一番最後だしな。ライブはそれより\n早く終わるけど……親御さんが心配してるのか？", "zh": "嗯，毕竟那是祭典的最后一个节目，\n至于演唱会结束的时间就比较早……你的家长会担心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0063_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "55231933c87890d150ba879cc465c8fe9682ebc34c4fa88c1680ae52c04b685f", "ja": "うん。わたしは大丈夫だよって言ったんだけど、\n育はまだ子どもだからダメって、おかあさんが……。", "zh": "嗯，我都叫他们不用担心了……\n但妈妈仍说我还是小孩子所以不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0063_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "1f53311ad54e7560178457fddc1b8fc82547d849d21cf5c9456dc201e09f1af5", "ja": "わたし、帰り道だってちゃんと覚えられるし、\n電車にだってひとりで乗れるのに。", "zh": "我明明就记得回家的路怎么走，\n也会一个人搭电车的说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0063_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f1ec1123121ca714151cb429fb946d02135ded9f13b26d614377ce415b634996", "ja": "いやいや、夜道を女の子ひとりで歩かせるのは、\n育が思ってる以上に危ないからな。", "zh": "不不，女孩子一个人晚上走在路上，\n比育想的还要危险喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0063_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c733200f1be4e5d9388e8f6f1b26f11eaf1a49915fd8c9c31d3c0f17c4ceba49", "ja": "それに、お祭り会場は人も多いし……アイドルの\n育をひとりで歩かせるのは、俺でも止めるかな。", "zh": "而且祭典会场人又多……\n要让育这个偶像独自走夜路，换作是我也会阻止吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0063_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "4eb4faa1d35156567916e2c6418237538a0f09252e9888e1e58e80bb7e7c5b49", "ja": "そっか……。じゃあ、やっぱりライブが終わったら、\n花火を見るまえに帰らないとダメなのかな……。", "zh": "是喔……那演唱会结束之后，\n我还是得在看烟火之前就回家吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0063_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4e399ba1694845c801515bc7b26006b31cb5dabf55ea0e0ffbdefcb2804d121c", "ja": "……育、そんなに花火が見たいのか？", "zh": "……育，你是不是非常想看烟火？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0063_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "82f7c972e0a6e188f20d3bd05b230e9dba9db3f278ceba1406af4cee2019a850", "ja": "うんっ！　だって花火って、\n空にお花が咲いたみたいでわくわくするでしょ♪", "zh": "嗯！因为烟火就像是天空中绽放的花朵，\n很让人兴奋啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0063_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "9888d9c5f10c3c5af2fae4b5f5914fb81d544d55611d471d0cf3388c6c418578", "ja": "小さいころは、おとうさんとおかあさんと一緒に\n見にいったりしたんだよ。すっごくきれいだった！", "zh": "我小时候也有和爸爸妈妈一起去看喔。\n真的超美的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0063_1012_p", "source_sha256": "549c4f6382f064912cd916cf2d8fb79d93f0a81bb069a3a49afc0a59591967bc", "ja": "そうか……よし、わかった。花火が終わるまで、\n俺が育と一緒にいよう。帰りは家まで送るよ。", "zh": "这样啊……好吧，我知道了。我会一直陪着育，\n直到放完烟火。回去时我送你回家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0063_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "2e5f13da4b2cc03aafd39497e0d23d3b7e61c276903262dcb5440e73de7c7ac6", "ja": "ほんとう！？\n{$P$}さん、ありがとう！", "zh": "真的吗！？\n{$P$}先生，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0063_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "9409c1dd4ed6797f1477dd422d892beeaf29079c933b6ecda08b1a1a18b6cac6", "ja": "{$P$}さんと一緒なら、おかあさんも\nいいって言うよね！　楽しみだな、えへへ♪", "zh": "如果是和{$P$}先生一起的话，\n妈妈也会答应吧！好期待喔，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0063_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d0975be685b0003f30b79612ebeccf5843035a9d0a251b23030669a49df69561", "ja": "そうだな。でも、あくまでメインはライブだからな？\n頼んだぞ、育！", "zh": "就是说啊。不过，重点还是要放在演唱会上喔。\n拜托你啰，育！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0063_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "7823fdb9a5e167a6bacbbcab1302e7678356c45289168e6fe8b51dcad2b510e2", "ja": "うんっ！　わたし、いっぱいがんばるよ！\n{$P$}さん、楽しみにしててね♪", "zh": "嗯！我会努力加油的！\n{$P$}先生，要好好期待喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
